Package: npdensity
Title: Nonprofit Density Research Frames and Multiverse Tools
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person("Jesse", "Lecy", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "jdlecy@asu.edu")
Description: Helpers shared by the nonprofit-density build and multiverse analysis:
    the NTEE validity rule and backfill, county and code utilities, the size
    transforms used by the models, a download helper that checks files against
    recorded sha256 hashes, readers that rebuild the released research frames
    from their per-year parquet slices, and the multiverse engine (specification
    grid, model fit and resumable parallel runner).
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/lecy/multiverse
BugReports: https://github.com/lecy/multiverse/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
